> - `studio/pipeline/routes.py` is ~2,400 lines with `_step_*` functions embedded (lines 1242â€“2371)
>   â€” service extraction (step 3.1) is the highest-risk step in the plan.
> - Backend tests exist (`tests/test_*.py`, pytest). Vitest, Vue Test Utils, jsdom,
