### IMPORTS
"""Pipeline Module â€” Orchestrates the full TTS â†’ Alignment â†’ Segment â†’ Scenes â†’ Storyboard â†’ Animator â†’ Build â†’ Export pipeline.

Provides:
  POST /api/pipeline/run           â€” start a pipeline job (returns job_id + project_id)
  POST /api/pipeline/<job_id>/stop â€” request a running pipeline to stop
  GET  /api/pipeline/progress/<id> â€” SSE stream of step-by-step progress
  GET  /api/pipeline/jobs          â€” list recent pipeline jobs
"""

